# space group P21 (b unique, b the chain axis) (No. 4), Z = 8 C6H11NO per cell; cell, space group and density p. 161; Table II p. 172 (heavy atoms)
# correction / model: molecule A's O z = -0.027 instead of the printed -0.007 (C=O 1.15 A as printed): molecule B prints -0.027, and molecule C, which the paper says is A displaced by 3/14 b and c/2 (p. 163), prints 0.473 = 0.5 - 0.027
# correction / model: molecules B and D: the CH2 zigzag phase swapped (x 0.544 <-> 0.460, z +-0.007 <-> -+0.007) so it fits their own N, C and O (as printed N-CH2 is 1.26 A and C(O)-CH2 1.19 A; swapped 1.48 and 1.44 A)
# hydrogens: none in the paper; placed by tools/make_polymer_crystals.py (CH2, NH; C-H 1.09 A sp3, 1.08 A sp2, N-H 1.01 A, tetrahedral / in-plane angles)
# pre-relaxed at the paper's fixed cell with OPLS-AA 2024 (caps relax, positions only) to remove clashes (before: H...H 1.71 A): heavy atoms moved 0.389 A RMS, 0.592 A at most
